---

> **Summary**: DeviceDNA has a strong architectural foundation — the Docker infrastructure, simulator, 4 ML model architectures, and a polished frontend are all scaffolded. The critical missing piece is the **end-to-end pipeline integration** (Gap 1) that connects Kafka → feature extraction → ML scoring → persistence → dashboard. Once that bridge is built, the platform transitions from a demo with mock data to a functional AI security system.
